Regex search across files. Flags: ignore_case, whole_word, glob ("*.rs"), include_hidden. mode="files" for per-file counts. Source hits carry their enclosing symbol. context_lines for surrounding code.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__codescout__grep(args: {
  // Context lines before/after each match (max 20). Adjacent matches merge.
  context_lines?: number;
  // Restrict to files matching glob(s), e.g. "*.rs" or ["src/**", "*.md"]
  glob?: string | Array<string>;
  // Case-insensitive match
  ignore_case?: boolean;
  // Also search hidden files/dirs (dotfiles, .github/)
  include_hidden?: boolean;
  // Max matching lines
  limit?: number;
  // "files" (= native output_mode count/files_with_matches): ranked files + counts, no lines
  mode?: "lines" | "files";
  // File or directory (default: project root)
  path?: string;
  // REQUIRED. Regex pattern
  pattern?: string;
  // Walk wall-clock ms (default 20000)
  time_budget_ms?: number;
  // Match whole words only (\b boundaries)
  whole_word?: boolean;
  // Absolute workspace path to resolve this call against; omit for the active project. For concurrent subagents in different workspaces.
  workspace?: string;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

